    "body": "Gate stopped for disk space (drive C: was full). The work is held on the pushed branch `issue/2620-gpu-compute-seam` at head `90c98be93632381f447e8d07abe89bf21b67dcd5`.\n\n- The quick gate ran as batch (the root manifest changed). It was stopped at step 857 of the plan. Steps 1-856 had no failure (817 steps `ok`). The `camcraft-gpu` steps come after the app suites and did not run in this gate.\n- Before the gate, these ran green on this head: `cargo test -p camcraft-gpu` (unit, `bin_parity`, `refusals`; the GPU path ran on the WARP software adapter), `gpu_parity_fixture_matches_the_grid` in `camcraft-motion`, `cargo test -p xtask`, and clippy `-D warnings` for `camcraft-gpu`, `camcraft-motion`, `camcraft-ui`.\n- The gate on the final head is owed. No PR is open yet. The claim stays.\n",
