    "body": "The maintainer reported in chat on 2026-11-22: \"bug; performance; P2; the stock simulation; is extremly slow. This was supposed to be calculated on the GPU as a shader, it doesnt seem to be the case..\" The report is #3336.\n\nThis issue is part of the fix of #3336. Its priority changes from P4 to P2, and its type from enhancement to bug. The order of the GPU path stays: #2620, then #2627, then #2629.\n",
